    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wicked Cabins is a cozy diorama builder with a spooky twist. There are no rules, no timers, and no goals\u2014just pure creative freedom to build eerie little hideaways in the world\u2019s most haunted, cursed, or downright infernal locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own peaceful retreats in four distinct diorama locations:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Woods - Where mushrooms glow and cauldrons bubble, set up your perfect spell-crafting little cabin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddb Transylvania - Among misty woods and crumbling castles, craft a gothic retreat fit for creatures of the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Hell - Surrounded by lava and lost souls, carve out a warm little corner in the underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 Swamp - In the heart of haunted Louisiana, summon comfort with the blessing of Baron Samedi himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no rush, no stress\u2014just the joy of turning haunted spaces into heartfelt ones. Take your time. Even the darkest places can eventually feel like home.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wicked Cabins is a cozy diorama builder with a spooky twist. There are no rules, no timers, and no goals\u2014just pure creative freedom to build eerie little hideaways in the world\u2019s most haunted, cursed, or downright infernal locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own peaceful retreats in four distinct diorama locations:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Woods - Where mushrooms glow and cauldrons bubble, set up your perfect spell-crafting little cabin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddb Transylvania - Among misty woods and crumbling castles, craft a gothic retreat fit for creatures of the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Hell - Surrounded by lava and lost souls, carve out a warm little corner in the underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 Swamp - In the heart of haunted Louisiana, summon comfort with the blessing of Baron Samedi himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no rush, no stress\u2014just the joy of turning haunted spaces into heartfelt ones. Take your time. Even the darkest places can eventually feel like home.</p>",
    "short_description": "Wicked Cabins is a tiny relaxing builder where you design cozy dioramas set in the most uncozy places. Create eerie little sanctuaries in a game with a horror twist, where you're not escaping the darkness - you\u2019re making it feel like home.",
